@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines a 30-day refund window through `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`. It does not establish when that window starts, other eligibility criteria, approval authority, or how a refund is executed. Explain the implemented window, but do not promise eligibility or completion when those facts are not established; escalate the request instead.
+
+For invoice questions, use only the invoice and account evidence available for the request. Do not infer payment status, charge validity, invoice dates, or adjustments. Escalate a dispute when the available evidence does not resolve it.

